    "font" : "Arial-BoldMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "A measurement of the force with respect to the current yields the force constant. The latter is shown in Figure 9 for three different drive voltages. We immediately notice a very strong structural"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
