    "font" : "Arial-BoldMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "response at 660 Hz due to the resonance of the structure originally intended to be rigid. By performing a modal analysis of this structure, we obtained its frequency response. The synthesized curve has been superimposed on the measured curves to emphasize the response due to the resonance of the beam structure."
